  "contentHtml": "<p>재해재난은 1주일에 1차시 들어가서 수업하는 단원이라 4차시로 만들었습니다.&#160;</p><p>크게 화재, 지진, 건물붕괴사고, 선박침몰사고, 압사 사고에 대해 영상을 보고, 추가 조사를 한 후, 대처방안을 찾아보고 정리하는 형태로 되어있습니다. 영상이 많습니다. 도움이 되셨으면 좋겠습니다.^^</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1e0f32eab7eab53096becbd262defa90324e7b14?download\" data-file-name=\"1차시-화재.pptx\" data-file-size=\"3250333\" data-mimetype=\"application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.presentationml.presentation\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHw%26dataid%3D501%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%3D20251108175110&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F1e0f32eab7eab53096becbd262defa90324e7b14')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">1차시-화재</span><span class=\"type\">.pptx</span></div><div class=\"size\">3.10MB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ecf6c26831bd6dd03562b3e703855676bcabdc2d?download\" data-file-name=\"2차시-지진.pptx\" data-file-size=\"270687\" data-mimetype=\"application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.presentationml.presentation\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHw%26dataid%3D501%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20251108175110&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fecf6c26831bd6dd03562b3e703855676bcabdc2d')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">2차시-지진</span><span class=\"type\">.pptx</span></div><div class=\"size\">264.34KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d6c611d4968ef4e75e2835e94a2938cb03234b47?download\" data-file-name=\"3차시-건축물붕괴.pptx\" data-file-size=\"958849\" data-mimetype=\"application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.presentationml.presentation\" data-ke-alig